---
source: crates/wows-query/tests/game_data.rs
expression: output
---
group: tier 10 battleships
ranked: 32
formula: "factor share = share of the other ships of the group (of the same tier for armor and offensive overmatch factors) whose value the ship's beats, ties counting half. A ship without a measured factor others have counts as worse than every ship with it and tied with the others without it; no funny button contributes zero funny-button utility. A factor marked unmeasured ranks only among peers that have it and is left out for ships without it. A family (gun_dpm, gun_alpha) takes the ship's best ammo, ranked among the ships with that ammo. component = weighted mean of its factor shares. Damage delivery = the power mean with exponent -8 of firepower, accuracy, gun handling, survivability and mobility after flooring each at 20%; it is multiplied by 65% for each of those components or reach that beats less than half of the group. Reach is a tactical weakness but not a linear damage bottleneck because dispersion is measured at 12 km. Score = damage delivery x71.5%, survivability x5%, funny-button utility x15%, unique-commander talent potential x5%, close quarters x1% and spotting x2.5%, 0 to 100."
weights:
  - "firepower 14.3%: effective_gun_damage x1, gun_dpm (best of dpm_ap, dpm_he, dpm_sap) x2, gun_alpha (best of alpha_ap, alpha_he, alpha_sap) x1.5, main_battery_reload x0.75, main_battery_range x0.25, ap_penetration x1, ap_fuse_threshold x0.5, cruiser_bow_overmatch x1, cruiser_full_bow_overmatch x0.75, cruiser_external_overmatch x0.5, main_sap_coverage x1.5"
  - "accuracy 14.3%: dispersion x1, vertical_dispersion x1, sigma x1"
  - "handling 14.3%: turret_traverse x0.5, bow_barrels x0.5, all_bear_from_bow x1"
  - "reach penalty only: main_battery_range x1"
  - "survivability 19.3%: health x1, repair_party_total_heal x1, damage_control_reload x0.25, bb_ap_citadel x0.75, bow_overmatch x0.5, cruiser_he_damaging x0.25"
  - "mobility 14.3%: speed x1, rudder_shift x1, turning_circle x1"
  - "spotting 2.5%: concealment x1, radar_range x1, hydro_range x0.5, torpedo_detection x0.25, smoke_lifetime x0.5, mobile_smoke_duration x1"
  - "utility 15%: funny_button_effect x1.25, funny_button_access x1"
  - "commander 5%: commander_talent_effect x1"
  - "close_quarters 1%: fires_per_minute x0.5, secondary_dpm x1, secondary_range x0.75, secondary_sap_coverage x0.75, torpedo_dpm x0.5"
